  curator: microbedecoder-import-review
  action: HELD_FOR_REVIEW
  changes: mapping_status MAPPED -> PENDING_REVIEW; SSSOM row withdrawn
  notes: 'Wrong-sense grounding. CHEBI:35358 ''sulfonamide'' is the structural functional-group
    class (2976 direct subclasses, spanning diuretics and herbicides). This record''s
    provenance is kgmicrobe.trait:sulfonamide, an antibiotic-resistance trait, so
    the intended target is almost certainly CHEBI:87228 ''sulfonamide antibiotic''
    (24 subclasses). Publishing skos:exactMatch to the functional group would license
    kg-microbe to collapse sulfonamide-resistance edges onto it, making furosemide
    a sibling of sulfamethoxazole under an asserted identity. Held for a curator;
    see #203.'
  llm_assisted: true
